{
  "id": "6aa5328d10a1b110cf1da958",
  "title": "勘で答えるハングル",
  "created": 1789211279,
  "updated": 1789211296,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6aa5328d10a1b110cf1da958",
      "text": "勘で答えるハングル",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa53292000000000031dff3",
      "text": "from [2026/9/12]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211283,
      "updated": 1789211287
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfe5",
      "text": " [Duolingo]の韓国語で読み方のアルファベットをオフにしてみたら何もわからなくなった [vlzs.icon]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211290
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfe6",
      "text": "  これまではアルファベットを見て答えていたのでハングルがわからない",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfe7",
      "text": "  雰囲気で誤魔化して答えられている",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfe8",
      "text": "   文字数がちょうど対応してるやつ、",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfe9",
      "text": "   字面でなんとなく覚えてたやつ、",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfea",
      "text": "    pang: 빵",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfeb",
      "text": "    水: 몰",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfec",
      "text": "    茶: 차",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfed",
      "text": "   ハングルの部品の一部、",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfee",
      "text": "    文字を覚えるゲームですでにやったやつ",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dfef",
      "text": "    `ㅅ`が`s`の音であるとか",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dff0",
      "text": "   丁寧語の語尾の요",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dff1",
      "text": "    [주세요]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5328f000000000031dff2",
      "text": "    [안녕하세요]",
      "userId": "63042e42f2ab90001d68385a",
      "created": 1789211279,
      "updated": 1789211279
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa5329d000000000031dff5",
